    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CINDY: I wouldn’t have the nerve to wear all those earrings. How do you do it?\nSAM: I wouldn’t have the nerve to chase somebody with a shotgun.\nCINDY: You heard about that? Oh, hell, it’s a shame, some people you just got to be real dramatic just to get their attention.\nCINDY: I got to take this cheese log over to the food table. I’ll get us some beers, honey.",
      "SAM: The Japanese used to be little, like the Viet Namese, but they’re not so little anymore since they started eating Big Macs. You think Americ…\nIRENE: Gahd, Sam, where do you dream these things up?",
      "IRENE: I didn’t mean to infer anything. It’s just not what I expected.\nSAM: Mom, it’s exactly what I want. Thank you.",
      "ANITA: Sam! Somebody said your Mom was here to take you up to Lexington to college, is that right?\nSAM: Going to the same school with your mother, I don’t know. That’s weird isn’t it?",
      "ANITA: I thought you were happy about the car.\nSAM: I am, and I just might take off in it for parts unknown."
    ]
  },
